    "hardRules": [
      "Exterior uga-hull is exterior-only and forbidden on interior floors, walls, furniture, facilities, machinery, crowns, or glazing.",
      "Floor, wall, transit, glazing, machinery, facility, display, and decal roles remain separable.",
      "Emission is texture-driven and limited to physically luminous strips, screens, indicators, and faint occupied panes.",
      "No halo geometry, painted bloom, giant luminous walls, or lighting baked into base color.",
      "Wear is deterministic and causal; no universal grime layer.",
      "Static decals are batched by atlas/material rather than one draw call per sticker."
